{"id":"653747","name":"鲜虾蔬菜水饺","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/653747/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑虎虾仁","amount":"300g"},{"name":"饺皮","amount":"32-38个不等"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"瓠子","amount":"半根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑虎虾去头剥壳，洗净。","img":"images/653747/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切小段。","img":"images/653747/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮，切片。","img":"images/653747/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"瓠子去皮切片。","img":"images/653747/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蔬菜打碎。","img":"images/653747/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蔬菜和虾仁拌匀。","img":"images/653747/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一匙白糖。","img":"images/653747/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"两匙盐。","img":"images/653747/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一勺料酒。","img":"images/653747/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"两勺生抽。","img":"images/653747/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"充分拌匀，挤去多余的水分。","img":"images/653747/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"准备好饺皮（也可以自己手擀饺皮）。","img":"images/653747/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/653747/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包起来，捏紧收口。","img":"images/653747/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撒上干粉，防止粘粘。","img":"images/653747/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"水烧开后，放入生饺子。","img":"images/653747/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"煮滚后，加一遍冷水。（如果是肉馅，需要加两遍冷水。）","img":"images/653747/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再次烧开后，捞出熟饺子。","img":"images/653747/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"蘸着醋吃，更棒～","img":"images/653747/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"晶莹透亮。","img":"images/653747/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"今天包的饺子。","img":"images/653747/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"前几天包饺子时，我是把蔬菜切丝。刀工不好，不好包。但口感比切碎了要好很多。","img":"images/653747/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"虾仁也没切今天这么小，口感更Q弹。","img":"images/653747/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"前两天包的同款饺子，口感比今天的好。","img":"images/653747/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}